message: "Please cite this software and separately cite Cheng and Nguyen's scientific formulation and GH/AGH algorithms."
type: software
title: "LLM Resource Allocation: verified Python and C++ reference"
authors:
  - family-names: "Arbizzani Tonelli"
    given-names: "Antonio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/antonio-arbizzani-tonelli/llm-resource-allocation"
