version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independently implemented and validated Python reference for heterogeneous
  LLM resource allocation, Pyomo deterministic MILP and Stage-2 LP, serial
  C++20 GH/AGH and OpenMP independent-case campaigns. Synthetic CPU planning
  evidence, not GPU-serving measurements or reproduction of paper tables.
